{"symbol":"EPBIO","yahoo":"EPBIO.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"EP Biocomposites Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","website":"https://epbiocomposites.com","about":"EP Biocomposites Limited manufactures and sells fibre reinforced polymer products in India. The company offers bio-digester toilets, sewage and effluent treatment plants, fibre reinforced polymer (FRP) doors, fire doors, and laminated doors; and passive fire protection products, including fire rated cable coating system and electrical/plumbing shaft sealing. It also provides FRP allied products, such as FRP garden benches, security cabins, FRP dust bins, roof tiles, FRP toilets, FRP decorative trims, FRP frames, FRP hydrant doors, FRP dam doors, hydrant doors, and FRP machine and water meter covers. EP Biocomposites Limited was founded in 1991 and is based in Panaji, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:21:15+00:00","quote":{"price":96.51,"prevClose":96.51,"marketCap":16.22,"high52":139.0,"low52":75.5,"pe":11.13,"bookValue":71.68,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":12.88,"shares":0.1681,"insiders":75.25,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2022-09-13","2022-09-14","2022-09-15","2022-09-16","2022-09-19","2022-09-20","2022-09-21","2022-09-22","2022-09-23","2022-09-26","2022-09-27","2022-09-28","2022-09-29","2022-09-30","2022-10-03","2022-10-04","2022-10-06","2022-10-07","2022-10-10","2022-10-11","2022-10-12","2022-10-13","2022-10-14","2022-10-17","2022-10-18","2022-10-19","2022-10-20","2022-10-21","2022-10-24","2022-10-25","2022-10-27","2022-10-28","2022-10-31","2022-11-01","2022-11-02","2022-11-03","2022-11-04","2022-11-07","2022-11-09","2022-11-10","2022-11-11","2022-11-14","2022-11-15","2022-11-16","2022-11-17","2022-11-18","2022-11-21","2022-11-22","2022-11-23","2022-11-24","2022-11-25","2022-11-28","2022-11-29","2022-11-30","2022-12-01","2022-12-02","2022-12-05","2022-12-06","2022-12-07","2022-12-08","2022-12-09","2022-12-12","2022-12-13","2022-12-14","2022-12-15","2022